  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:** **Third Number = (First Number + Second Number) × 2**.\n\nFor, (**25, 72, 194)**\n\n⇒ 25 + 72 = 97\n\n⇒ 97 × 2 = 194\n\nFor, **(32, 80, 224)**\n\n⇒ 32 + 80 = 112\n\n⇒ 112 × 2 = 224\n\nNow, checking the options using the same pattern:\n\n**Option 1) (45, 89, 268)**\n\n⇒ 45 + 89 = 134\n\n⇒ 134 × 2 = 268\n\nOption 2) (74, 88, 304)\n\n⇒ 74 + 88 = 162\n\n⇒ 162 × 2 = 324 ≠ 304\n\nOption 3) (91, 65, 310)\n\n⇒ 91 + 65 = 156\n\n⇒ 156 × 2 = 312 ≠ 310\n\nOption 4) (56, 98, 312)\n\n⇒ 56 + 98 = 154\n\n⇒ 154 × 2 = 308 ≠ 312\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 1.**",
